FACTORY QUOTES FOR LUNCH BOX
RFQ-900004 responses from three shortlisted factories for the insulated lunch box (SKU-106314, style STY-9502)

REQUEST: 60,000 units insulated lunch box, target cost £3.20 FOB, minimum order 25,000 units

FACTORY A QUOTE (Jackson Trading Pvt Ltd, SUP-0022, factory FAC-0042, Turkey):
Unit cost: £3.10 FOB (60,000 units: £186,000)
Lead time: 60 days
Tooling cost: £8,500
Capacity available: 50,000 units (cannot cover the full 60,000 in one run)
Capability: Makes plastic food containers; has not made vacuum-insulated lunch boxes before
Certifications: ISO 9001
Compliance: Social audit documentation not supplied with the quote

FACTORY B QUOTE (Stone Homewares Pvt Ltd, SUP-0010, factory FAC-0021, China):
Unit cost: £3.25 FOB (60,000 units: £195,000)
Lead time: 50 days
Tooling cost: £7,500
Capacity available: 60,000 units
Capability: Insulated drinkware and lunch boxes in current production
Certifications: ISO 9001, WRAP
Compliance: Audit documentation supplied with the quote

FACTORY C QUOTE (Wilson Manufacturing A.S., SUP-0012, factory FAC-0023, France):
Unit cost: £3.40 FOB (60,000 units: £204,000)
Lead time: 45 days
Tooling cost: £9,000
Capacity available: 55,000 units
Capability: Insulated food containers in current production
Certifications: BSCI
Compliance: Audit documentation supplied with the quote

SUMMARY:
Only Factory A is under the £3.20 target at £3.10, but it has the longest lead time, no insulated lunch box experience and capacity for only 50,000 units.
Factory C is the fastest but the most expensive and above target.
